sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront> a pk:Claim ;
        rdfs:label "Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquié (2007) / Baker, Schnell & Maini (2006) RA–FGF8/Wnt mutual cross-inhibition bistable determination wavefront in vertebrate somitogenesis faithfully reproduces Gallus gallus (chick embryo presomitic mesoderm & paraxial somites) morphology" ;
        dcterms:description "The simulation script(s) 2012-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Gallus gallus (chick embryo presomitic mesoderm & paraxial somites) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 91.2/100, audit 2026-10-19-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2012-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront.py> ;
        pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2012-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront.py; output: docs/media/fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront_comparison.png; organism: Gallus gallus (chick embryo presomitic mesoderm & paraxial somites); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 067326af3885ea73d93878ed07f29a5a29f47fffe07fbd95bba8a7110f414601; artifact_sha256: 499ddc7eed5384bbf4d6f0118814a3c67b19b1d52d6608fcfe526a0864146bde; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront/chick_ra_fgf_somites_specimen.jpg=8b80971796cb29e2..., datasets/fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront/fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront_reference.json=42c6196ddd32cee9..., datasets/fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront/scout_manifest.json=783faa9ee6b3db0c...}; supersedes_audit_id: 2026-10-19-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-audit; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquie (2007) Dev. Cell / Dev. Dyn. 236:1495-1508 mutual cross-inhibition + CYP26A1 RA-degradation PDEs producing an S-shaped hysteresis curve [M_1, M_2] and an all-or-none determination front switch | Baker, Schnell & Maini (2006) J. Theor. Biol. 239:413-429 & Diez del Corral et al. (2003) Neuron 40:65-79 opposing Vitamin A Deficiency (VAD) anterior front shift vs exogenous RA / SU5402 posterior front shift; reconstructed_in_script: Analytical inverse hysteresis S-curve M(F) solver extracting lower saddle-node M_1 = 1.0254 nM and upper saddle-node M_2 = 3.3038 nM (Delta_M = 2.2784 nM) | 1D coupled RA-FGF8/Wnt reaction-diffusion PDE solver along the 1000 um chick PSM demonstrating 22.2x sharpening of the determination front (Delta_x_front = 16.24 um vs lambda_M = 360.67 um) at x_front = 571.46 um | 5-regime somite perturbation evaluator (WT, VAD, exogenous RA, SU5402, ectopic FGF8 bead; Pearson r = 0.9999, RMSE = 0.84 um) plus bilateral dorsal somite row segmentation on chick_ra_fgf_somites_specimen.jpg (48.47 px mean spacing); transfer_boundary: 1D anteroposterior chick presomitic mesoderm axis mapped to dorsal vertebrate SEM somite rows; does_not_claim: Full 3D mesenchymal-to-epithelial somite rosette mechanics or explicit intracellular Her1/Hes7 delayed transcriptional clock ODEs]" ;
        pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1002/dvdy.21193>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0896-6273(03)00565-8>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2007.05.015>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2005.07.019>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ydbio.2006.01.018>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature03488> ;
        pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-code-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-model-fidelity>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-morphometric-validation>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-overall>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-parameter-expressivity>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-repro-package>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-source-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-specimen-match> ;
        pk:weightOfEvidence "0.912"^^xsd:double .

    <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2012-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront.py> a schema:SoftwareSourceCode ;
